# Raw generations are committed deliberately, not ignored: they are the
# evidence behind every number in the post, and at a few hundred KB the cost of
# keeping them is trivial next to being able to prove a result.
#
# numeracy-raw.jsonl              the run the published figures come from
# numeracy-pilot-contended.jsonl  an earlier run of three of the four models,
#                                 made while 6 GB of models were downloading.
#                                 Kept because comparing the two is what
#                                 demonstrates the reproducibility claim:
#                                 240/240 answers identical across both.
